{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Archimedean.SigmaJGeometricCarrier","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SigmaJGeometricCarrier","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Init.Data.Int.Basic"],"declarations":30,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SigmaJGeometricCarrier.transpose_fixes_degenerate_pair","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SigmaJGeometricCarrier.transpose_fixes_degenerate_pair","kind":"theorem","line":122,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SigmaJGeometricCarrier.lean#L122-L125","doc":"**Role-swap, transpose side:** the transpose `z ↦ −z⁻¹` (for circle units\n`z⁻¹ = conj z`, so `transpose z = −(conj z)`) FIXES each degenerate point. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SigmaJGeometricCarrier.bar_exchanges_degenerate_pair","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SigmaJGeometricCarrier.bar_exchanges_degenerate_pair","kind":"theorem","line":117,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SigmaJGeometricCarrier.lean#L117-L120","doc":"**Role-swap, bar side:** `conj` (= bar on the unit circle) EXCHANGES the\ndegenerate pair `{i, −i}`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SigmaJGeometricCarrier.conj_swaps_families","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SigmaJGeometricCarrier.conj_swaps_families","kind":"theorem","line":111,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SigmaJGeometricCarrier.lean#L111-L115","doc":"**G3b (conjugation swaps the families).** Componentwise complex conjugation\nmaps `V` to `W` — conjugation exchanges the `+i`- and `−i`-multiplier vertex\nfamilies, exactly as bar exchanges the degenerate points `q = ±i` and as\nconjugation exchanges `spec(J)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SigmaJGeometricCarrier.conj_cycle_multiplier_neg_i","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SigmaJGeometricCarrier.conj_cycle_multiplier_neg_i","kind":"theorem","line":106,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SigmaJGeometricCarrier.lean#L106-L109","doc":"**G3a (conjugate multiplier `−i`).** `U·conj(V) = (−i)·conj(V)`: the\nconjugate vertex carries the other `J`-eigenvalue. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SigmaJGeometricCarrier.cycle_multiplier_i","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SigmaJGeometricCarrier.cycle_multiplier_i","kind":"theorem","line":101,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SigmaJGeometricCarrier.lean#L101-L104","doc":"**G2 (multiplier `i`).** `U·V = i·V` componentwise: the order-4 automorphism\nfixes `V` projectively with multiplier exactly `i` — the democratic `q`. Hence\n`dU|_V = i = J|_V`: the (2,4,5) order-4 rotation realizes `J` at the vertex. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SigmaJGeometricCarrier.H3_vanishes","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SigmaJGeometricCarrier.H3_vanishes","kind":"theorem","line":95,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SigmaJGeometricCarrier.lean#L95-L99","doc":"`H₃(V) = Σ xᵢ³ = 0`: the third Bring equation — with `H₁, H₂` this places\n`V` on Bring's curve exactly. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SigmaJGeometricCarrier.H2_vanishes","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SigmaJGeometricCarrier.H2_vanishes","kind":"theorem","line":91,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SigmaJGeometricCarrier.lean#L91-L93","doc":"`H₂(V) = Σ xᵢ² = 0`: the second Bring equation. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SigmaJGeometricCarrier.H1_vanishes","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SigmaJGeometricCarrier.H1_vanishes","kind":"theorem","line":86,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SigmaJGeometricCarrier.lean#L86-L89","doc":"**G1 (power sums vanish).** `H₁(V) = Σ xᵢ = 0`: the vertex satisfies the\nfirst Bring equation. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SigmaJGeometricCarrier.i_sq_eq_neg_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SigmaJGeometricCarrier.i_sq_eq_neg_one","kind":"theorem","line":82,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SigmaJGeometricCarrier.lean#L82-L84","doc":"`i² = −1`: the semisimplified braiding at the democratic points is a square\nroot of `−1` — type-correct with the complex structure `J`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SigmaJGeometricCarrier.cyc","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SigmaJGeometricCarrier.cyc","kind":"def","line":78,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SigmaJGeometricCarrier.lean#L78-L80","doc":"The order-4 automorphism `U` = coordinate 4-cycle `(x₁x₂x₃x₄)` (fixes `x₅`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SigmaJGeometricCarrier.W","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SigmaJGeometricCarrier.W","kind":"def","line":74,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SigmaJGeometricCarrier.lean#L74-L76","doc":"Its complex conjugate `conj(V) = (1, −i, −1, i, 0)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SigmaJGeometricCarrier.V","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SigmaJGeometricCarrier.V","kind":"def","line":69,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SigmaJGeometricCarrier.lean#L69-L72","doc":"The Bring vertex `V = (1, i, −1, −i, 0)` (affine representative in the\n`P⁴` model). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SigmaJGeometricCarrier.GInt.I","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SigmaJGeometricCarrier.GInt.I","kind":"def","line":63,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SigmaJGeometricCarrier.lean#L63-L63","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SigmaJGeometricCarrier.GInt.one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SigmaJGeometricCarrier.GInt.one","kind":"def","line":62,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SigmaJGeometricCarrier.lean#L62-L62","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SigmaJGeometricCarrier.GInt.zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SigmaJGeometricCarrier.GInt.zero","kind":"def","line":61,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SigmaJGeometricCarrier.lean#L61-L61","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SigmaJGeometricCarrier.GInt.instNeg","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SigmaJGeometricCarrier.GInt.instNeg","kind":"instance","line":59,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SigmaJGeometricCarrier.lean#L59-L59","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SigmaJGeometricCarrier.GInt.instMul","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SigmaJGeometricCarrier.GInt.instMul","kind":"instance","line":58,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SigmaJGeometricCarrier.lean#L58-L58","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SigmaJGeometricCarrier.GInt.instAdd","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SigmaJGeometricCarrier.GInt.instAdd","kind":"instance","line":57,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SigmaJGeometricCarrier.lean#L57-L57","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SigmaJGeometricCarrier.GInt.conj","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SigmaJGeometricCarrier.GInt.conj","kind":"def","line":55,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SigmaJGeometricCarrier.lean#L55-L55","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SigmaJGeometricCarrier.GInt.neg","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SigmaJGeometricCarrier.GInt.neg","kind":"def","line":54,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SigmaJGeometricCarrier.lean#L54-L54","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SigmaJGeometricCarrier.GInt.mul","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SigmaJGeometricCarrier.GInt.mul","kind":"def","line":53,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SigmaJGeometricCarrier.lean#L53-L53","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SigmaJGeometricCarrier.GInt.add","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SigmaJGeometricCarrier.GInt.add","kind":"def","line":52,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SigmaJGeometricCarrier.lean#L52-L52","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SigmaJGeometricCarrier.instReprGInt","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SigmaJGeometricCarrier.instReprGInt","kind":"instance","line":48,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SigmaJGeometricCarrier.lean#L48-L48","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SigmaJGeometricCarrier.instReprGInt.repr","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SigmaJGeometricCarrier.instReprGInt.repr","kind":"def","line":48,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SigmaJGeometricCarrier.lean#L48-L48","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SigmaJGeometricCarrier.instDecidableEqGInt.decEq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SigmaJGeometricCarrier.instDecidableEqGInt.decEq","kind":"def","line":48,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SigmaJGeometricCarrier.lean#L48-L48","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SigmaJGeometricCarrier.instDecidableEqGInt","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SigmaJGeometricCarrier.instDecidableEqGInt","kind":"instance","line":48,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SigmaJGeometricCarrier.lean#L48-L48","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SigmaJGeometricCarrier.GInt.im","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SigmaJGeometricCarrier.GInt.im","kind":"def","line":47,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SigmaJGeometricCarrier.lean#L47-L47","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SigmaJGeometricCarrier.GInt.re","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SigmaJGeometricCarrier.GInt.re","kind":"def","line":46,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SigmaJGeometricCarrier.lean#L46-L46","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SigmaJGeometricCarrier.GInt.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SigmaJGeometricCarrier.GInt.mk","kind":"ctor","line":45,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SigmaJGeometricCarrier.lean#L45-L45","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SigmaJGeometricCarrier.GInt","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SigmaJGeometricCarrier.GInt","kind":"structure","line":44,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/SigmaJGeometricCarrier.lean#L44-L48","doc":"Gaussian integers as pairs of `Int` (re, im), Lean-core only. ","signatureChunk":0}]}